      "text": "BOYS OF SUMMER BASEBALL KNOCKS IT OUT OF PARK\nAugust 28, 2025\n\nWritten by Kara Gates\n\nThere’s something about summer baseball that feels like magic. The smell of the grass, the crack of the bat, the long evenings where the sun just won’t quit — it’s pure nostalgia wrapped in a diamond. Panini’s 2025 Boys of Summer Baseball trading cards capture that exact feeling, delivering a set that celebrates the game’s legends, today’s stars and the prospects destined to be tomorrow’s heroes.\n\nThis year, the lineup steps up to the plate ready to hit it out of the park. For the first time in Boys of Summer history, collectors can chase On-Card Autographs in the highly anticipated Jumbo Material Signatures series, featuring names like Bobby Witt Jr., Paul Skenes and Travis Bazzana. It’s a debut that promises heat hotter than any July afternoon.\n\nOf course, the magic doesn’t stop there. Signature sets return in style with Baseball Signatures, Lumber Signatures and Leather Signatures bringing a variety of textures and designs that feel as unique as the players themselves. And brand new for 2025, the Jumbo Acetate Signatures arrive with a modern twist, offering stunning, clear-cut designs showcasing top prospects in a way you’ve never seen before.\n\nEach box keeps the excitement rolling with an average of 3 Autographs and 1 Memorabilia card, making every rip feel like a ninth-inning walk-off. Whether you’re chasing future stars or honoring the legends who built the game, Boys of Summer delivers a collecting experience drenched in the spirit of baseball’s best.\n\nThis isn’t just another release. It’s peanuts, hot dogs and the thrill of the game packed into every card. The 2025 Boys of Summer set swings for the fences, and it’s about to clear them all.\n\nAutographs\n,\nBaseball\n,\nBoys of Summer Baseball\n2025 Baseball Cards\n,\n2025 Boys of Summer Baseball Cards\n,\nautographs\n,\nbaseball cards\n,\nbaseball trading cards\n,\nPanini Baseball Cards\n,\nsports cards\n,\nwho do you collect\nPost navigation\nPrevious Post\nPrevious\nORIGINS FOOTBALL IS PERFECT START FOR COLLECTORS\nNext Post\nNext\nQBs HIGHLIGHT MUST-SEE COLLEGE MATCHUP",
      "url": "https://blog.paniniamerica.net/boys-of-summer-baseball-knocks-it-out-of-park/"
